{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "167", "x": 0.8959551137550246, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03778813484861114, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Part 2", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.12393667166651151, "w": 0.07324626196581552, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Archaeologist (Hayden): Hello, I'm Hayden. I'm one of the archaeologists", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.14277420698693738, "w": 0.7719144269321571, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "investigating the site here at Bidcaster. This is the third summer for this", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.16161166686457823, "w": 0.7713697118525921, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "community project and most of the people digging here are volunteers. I'm", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.18059744725757176, "w": 0.7714129773830977, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "a full-time archaeologist for the town council, but I was asked to join the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.19943490713521264, "w": 0.7713605871317034, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "project by NHA, a charity which sets up projects like this up and down the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2182723670128535, "w": 0.7714889483738671, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "country. As you can see, we're next to Bidcaster Castle, which is great", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.23725822284863204, "w": 0.7714565504884647, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "because the owners let us use their facilities.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2560956827262729, "w": 0.4675725361485045, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "So, how did we get to where we are today? Many archaeology projects", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.27497018501135945, "w": 0.7721817094867263, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "happen when an ancient object is found. And in our case, that object was a", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2938077203317853, "w": 0.7712606253017438, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "gold coin. Coins are often found by people using metal detectors to look for", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.31279350072477885, "w": 0.7716089025698187, "h": 0.018822616509687834, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "things buried in the ground. Or coins are uncovered when wild animals like", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3316309417417234, "w": 0.7713478740374317, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "rabbits have been digging tunnels. Here, a walker found it on the ground", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.35046840161936427, "w": 0.7716477595273108, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "after a rainstorm washed away some of the earth and sand. When the story", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.36945418201235786, "w": 0.7714568580633262, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "of the gold coin hit the news, Peter Swift, an amateur historian, contacted", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3882917173327837, "w": 0.7715654319894055, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "me to say he believed there had been a village on this site centuries before", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.40712913948903207, "w": 0.7721161960412449, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the castle was built. Just by chance, the team found some old maps and", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4259666370880654, "w": 0.7714350202481658, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "documents in our library, which showed 500-year-old drawings of ruined", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.44495241748105896, "w": 0.7720409427251522, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "buildings on the grassy area between the outer stone walls of the castle and", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4637898773586998, "w": 0.7715875773794273, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the river. We knew then we were on to something.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.48265208246982777, "w": 0.5137326024124327, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Over the three summers the team has been here, we found the remains of", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5016379005842139, "w": 0.7713262412721789, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "several buildings and more broken pots than you can count. Normally, you'd", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5204753604618547, "w": 0.771543594174245, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "expect to find brooches and other jewelry, but we're still waiting to uncover", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5393128203394956, "w": 0.7721986261041041, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "any such items. The people who once lived here were skilled at making tools", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5582986384538816, "w": 0.7715873723295197, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "from animal bones, as you'll see when you visit the exhibition. Besides the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5771360983315225, "w": 0.7713913446178449, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "discovery of the village, we've also found evidence of human activity on the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5959735582091633, "w": 0.7713043009320646, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "other side of the river. No other houses or huts so far, but we can see the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6148110558081967, "w": 0.7715206285845928, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "borders of an ancient field system. At one point, we found a long wall and", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6337967984797978, "w": 0.7713044034570185, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "thought it was an ancient palace, but it turned out to be a modern wall. This", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6526343338002236, "w": 0.7711954194311239, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "summer's work will end soon, but we'll be back next summer. In the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6715088360853101, "w": 0.7720453512981659, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "meantime, we're putting on a series of guided tours for school groups this", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6904946164783037, "w": 0.7713912420928911, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "autumn. Oh, and um maybe you saw the TV documentary about our project", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7093321517987295, "w": 0.7713475664625702, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "that suggested the objects we found are going to the town's museum, but", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7281696116763704, "w": 0.7715220639339461, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "we don't know that for sure yet.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7470070715540112, "w": 0.33127611887276276, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "When you enter the site, please make sure you keep to the paths at all times.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7659929273897897, "w": 0.771630842909933, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "There are a few other things um the highlights of the site if you like that I", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7848303872674306, "w": 0.7713916521927063, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "want to mention. Take a look at the map. Our present location is marked at", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8036678471450714, "w": 0.7715001235938318, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the bottom.", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.822653627538065, "w": 0.12783928762381297, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "This year we've identified the foundations of an ancient bridge. And it's really", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8414910874157059, "w": 0.771579888007892, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "exciting today because a team of divers are in the river searching for lost", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8603532925268339, "w": 0.7715003286437394, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "objects. To reach the bridge, take the main path ahead of you. Go straight on", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8791907524044748, "w": 0.7716963563554142, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "and keep going till the path bends to the left. You'll see a smaller track", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8981765327974682, "w": 0.7715923960522562, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "leading off to the right. Follow that to take you to the river where the divers", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.9170139926751091, "w": 0.7712172572462843, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "are. You might be interested to see the rubbish pit. This is very near the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.935851527995535, "w": 0.7712174622961919, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}